## 11. Term and termination

These terms apply for as long as You exercise rights under them. Your rights
terminate automatically if You materially breach these terms.

For a first breach other than a patent claim under Section 9, Your rights are
reinstated if You fully cure the breach and take reasonable steps to remedy
its effects within thirty days after receiving written notice. A repeated
breach of the same kind is not eligible for automatic reinstatement.

Termination does not end licenses properly granted to recipients who remain
in compliance, but it does end Your right to continue using, modifying, or
Distributing the Covered Software except as permitted by applicable law or a
separate written agreement.

